{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8690dec9-3c11-811f-b7dd-ca7fa61277a3",
  "created_at": "2026-03-06T10:04:39-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Diego Castillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:02:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra, good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:02:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hey, yeah, hi. I'm trying to report a power outage. Is this the electric company?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:02:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no, hon, this is the City Clerk at Newport City Hall. We don't handle the electric. You'd want the utility itself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:03:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wicked, okay. So I got this number off a [line breaks up] sorry, can you hear me? My service is spotty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:03:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you, a little choppy but go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:03:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I thought I dialed the right one. I used the area code, um, four-oh-one, but a buddy said it might be a different one now? I'm totally confused on that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:03:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one is right for Newport, that's still our area code. You probably just got a digit off somewhere, or the number you had was for something else."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:03:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's probably it. I was reading it off an old bill, I think. [pause] Honestly I just want to get through to the right people."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:03:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Look on the most recent bill or the utility's website for the outage reporting line. Most of them have an automated number for outages, and you can usually report it online too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:03:57-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, got it. My friend told me to be firm when I call, like don't let them brush me off. But I'm honestly not good at that. I just say okay and hang up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:04:09-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, an outage report is pretty straightforward. Have your account number or your address handy and they'll log it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:04:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. That's totally fair. The rain's coming down wicked hard here so I figure I'm not the only one calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:04:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Probably not. It's supposed to keep up through tomorrow. Stay safe, and I hope the lights come back soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:04:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, appreciate it. Sorry for the wrong number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:04:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble at all. Take care now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:04:37-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
